  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.000" end="00:01.500" ttm:agent="v1">作词 : JVon A Pitts</p>
      <p begin="00:00.707" end="00:02.207" ttm:agent="v1">作曲 : JVon A Pitts</p>
      <p begin="00:01.414" end="00:02.914" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Swaggy B on the beat!)</p>
      <p begin="00:02.352" end="00:03.852" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p>
      <p begin="00:03.305" end="00:11.305" ttm:agent="v1">Aye, aye yuh aye, aye, aye, aye, yuh</p>
      <p begin="00:14.416" end="00:15.916" ttm:agent="v1">COURT GUARD</p>
      <p begin="00:15.181" end="00:16.709" ttm:agent="v1">Why you running through my brain</p>
      <p begin="00:16.709" end="00:20.367" ttm:agent="v1">She wan’ hit me up ‘cause she addicted to the fame</p>
      <p begin="00:20.367" end="00:24.063" ttm:agent="v1">She don’t even love me im accustomed to the pain</p>
      <p begin="00:24.063" end="00:27.771" ttm:agent="v1">How you finna leave me bitch like we ain’t built the same</p>
      <p begin="00:27.771" end="00:31.415" ttm:agent="v1">Why you acting shady imma treat you like a lame</p>
      <p begin="00:31.415" end="00:35.100" ttm:agent="v1">****in’ up my mood I’m finna hop up on a plane</p>
      <p begin="00:35.100" end="00:38.877" ttm:agent="v1">Headed to Japan ‘cause i’m addicted to the rain</p>
      <p begin="00:38.877" end="00:42.266" ttm:agent="v1">She just want the compass, but I hit up Johnny Dang</p>
      <p begin="00:42.266" end="00:43.766" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p>
      <p begin="00:42.553" end="00:48.553" ttm:agent="v1">I just want a shawty who won’t treat me like a phase ‘cause i’m up now, choppa’ buss down</p>
      <p begin="00:48.553" end="00:52.171" ttm:agent="v1">Imma put you on a bus now, don’t test yo love now</p>
      <p begin="00:52.171" end="00:55.936" ttm:agent="v1">I’m that nigga that you cuff, that you wanna **** now</p>
      <p begin="00:55.936" end="00:58.721" ttm:agent="v1">Imma treat you like you rust, I don’t give a **** now</p>
      <p begin="00:58.721" end="01:00.221" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p>
      <p begin="00:59.538" end="01:01.917" ttm:agent="v1">‘Cause my soul is finna bleed</p>
      <p begin="01:01.917" end="01:03.736" ttm:agent="v1">Roll-up in my sleeve</p>
      <p begin="01:03.736" end="01:07.476" ttm:agent="v1">I’m in love with you and shawty, you a different breed</p>
      <p begin="01:07.476" end="01:09.306" ttm:agent="v1">Bound to find the things</p>
      <p begin="01:09.306" end="01:11.207" ttm:agent="v1">Moving like the breeze</p>
      <p begin="01:11.207" end="01:12.707" ttm:agent="v1">I’m just finna leave</p>
      <p begin="01:12.561" end="01:14.061" ttm:agent="v1">Forget talking rest in peace</p>
      <p begin="01:13.922" end="01:15.422" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 3]</p>
      <p begin="01:14.363" end="01:16.696" ttm:agent="v1">Baby i’m just tryna cope</p>
      <p begin="01:16.696" end="01:18.516" ttm:agent="v1">I been losing hope</p>
      <p begin="01:18.516" end="01:22.236" ttm:agent="v1">Smoking on this gas I’m addicted to the smoke</p>
      <p begin="01:22.236" end="01:24.077" ttm:agent="v1">I don’t even tote</p>
      <p begin="01:24.077" end="01:25.928" ttm:agent="v1">Blade chop your throat</p>
      <p begin="01:25.928" end="01:28.395" ttm:agent="v1">Moving in a foreign flexing harder than the pope</p>
      <p begin="01:28.395" end="01:29.895" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 4]</p>
      <p begin="01:28.760" end="01:30.533" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch i’m ‘Pachii</p>
      <p begin="01:30.533" end="01:32.419" ttm:agent="v1">Rain on my watch piece</p>
      <p begin="01:32.419" end="01:36.073" ttm:agent="v1">She wan’ hit me up but shawty you just finna top me</p>
      <p begin="01:36.073" end="01:37.573" ttm:agent="v1">And slop me</p>
      <p begin="01:37.147" end="01:38.901" ttm:agent="v1">Don’t try and stop me</p>
      <p begin="01:38.901" end="01:42.941" ttm:agent="v1">Niggas always hating but these niggas steady copy</p>
      <p begin="01:42.941" end="01:46.941" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch you is not me</p>
    </div>
